l w-full flex-col overflow-hidden border border-[#e7e7e7] bg-white rounded-2xl lg:rounded-tl-[3rem] lg:rounded-tr-[0.5rem] lg:rounded-br-[3rem] lg:rounded-bl-[0.5rem] group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative w-full h-[6.25rem] md:h-[7.25rem] lg:h-[7rem] custom-1272:h-[9rem] custom-1366:h-[10.25rem] overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2e\",null,{\"src\":\"https://synegmc-strapi-bucket.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/qaunidev/Sept_Case_Studies_Fiserv_business_outcomes_Desktop_6a14ec9290.webp\",\"alt\":\"Modernizing Card Processing for a Global Payments Platform Provider\",\"fill\":true,\"className\":\"object-cover origin-bottom transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:scale-105\",\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 50vw, 33vw\",\"quality\":\"$undefined\",\"unoptimized\":false}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-grow flex-col p-5 pb-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center bg-[#E5E9EA] px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded text-xs font-semibold leading-none text-[#002535]\",\"children\":\"Digital\"}]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-[1.250rem] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#002535] line-clamp-3 group-hover:italic transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out\",\"children\":\"Modernizing Card Processing for a Global Payments Platform Provider\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-[1rem] leading-[1.5] text-[#4D5050] line-clamp-3\",\"children\":\"Supporting a global payments platform provider across migration, modernization, product development and 24/7 operations.\"}],null]}]]}]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"31:T411,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"**Faisal Husain**, co-founder of Synechron, has held the roles of chief executive officer and chairman of the board of directors since the company's inception in April 2001.\n\nEarly in his career, Faisal worked at some of the most well-known firms in the financial services industry, such as Dun \u0026 Bradstreet Holdings, Inc. (NYSE: DNB) and Merrill Lynch \u0026 Co., later acquired by Bank of America's Corp (NYSE:BAC).\n\nAt the age of 26, Faisal partnered with two other co-founders to create Synechron, focusing on developing innovative solutions based on deep industry knowledge and highly experienced project teams.\n\nUnder his leadership, Synechron has seen rapid global growth. Faisal's unique approach of bootstrapping the company without raising outside equity has allowed Synechron to build with a long-term mindset, successfully navigating several economic cycles.\n\nHe holds a Bachelor of Science in Aeronautical Engineering from Vaughn College of Aeronautics and Technology and a Master of Science in Computer Science from Pace University."])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"32:T4fa,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"**Kerrie MacPherson**  joined our board of directors in April 2022, having previously been a senior partner of Ernst \u0026 Young, LLP, where she worked for over 32 years. Kerrie served on the board of directors of SpartanNash Company (formerly NASDAQ: SPTN) from August 2023 until September 22, 2025, when the company was taken private by C\u0026S Wholesale Grocers. She continues to serve on the board of directors of Community Financial System, Inc. (formerly Community Bank System, Inc.), where she has served since December 2019. Previously, Kerrie served on the board of directors of New York City Harvest, a nonprofit organization focused on feeding the hungry in New York City, from 2006 to 2023, and served on the Dean's Advisory Board and the Global Advancement Board at the Rotman School of Management, University of Toronto. \n\nKerrie holds a Bachelor of Commerce from the University of Toronto, Canada, and a Master of Business Administration from the Rotman School of Management, University of Toronto, Canada. She is a Chartered Accountant and a Fellow of the Chartered Professional Accountants of Ontario and has been recognized by Directors \u0026 Boards, Consulting Magazine, Canada's Top 40 Under 40, and others. "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"33:T456,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"**H. C. Charles Diao** has been on our board of directors since April 2022. He has been Senior Vice President, Finance and Corporate Treasurer of Bally’s Corporation (NYSE: BALY) since 2023, and from 2017 to 2021, he served as Senior Vice President of Finance, Corporate Development and Corporate Treasurer at DXC Technology Co (NYSE: DXC); he was previously Vice President and Corporate Treasurer of its predecessor, Computer Sciences Corp., from 2012 to 2017. Charlie has also held a number of senior roles at his family companies, Diao \u0026 Co, LLC and Diao Capital Management LLC. Charlie is also on the board of directors at Griffon Corporation (NYSE: GFF), a diversified manufacturing and holding company, and at Turning Point Brands, Inc. (NYSE: TPB), a manufacturer, marketer, and distributor of branded consumer products. He was previously a director at Media General Inc. (NYSE: MEG), a broadcast television and digital media company, from 2012 to 2017.\n\nCharlie holds a Bachelor of Science in Engineering from Princeton University and a Master of Business Administration from Harvard Business School."])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"34:T483,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"**Amit Singh** has served on our board since April 2024. He is an accomplished IT strategy consulting and technology professional with more than 25 years of experience in the investment banking world. Amit began his business consulting career at Lovelock \u0026 Lewes, before taking roles at Cambridge Technology Partners (CTP), where he delivered IT strategy and CRM solutions for major global clients, and Symphony Services, where he led internal corporate development and M\u0026A. \n\nHe later joined Avendus Capital to head its Enterprise Technology Services investment banking business and, over an 18‑year period, made a significant contribution to the growth of Avendus as one of India’s foremost investment banks. In addition to his tenure at Avendus, Amit also served as a director of Straatix Technology Labs Private Limited and as a designated partner of Straatix Partners LLP between 2023 and 2025. \n\nAmit holds a bachelor’s degree in electrical and electronics engineering and a Master of Science in physics from the Birla Institute of Technology and Science, Pilani (BITS), and an MBA from the Xavier Institute of Management, Bhubaneswar (XIMB). "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"25:[\"$\",\"$L30\",null,{\"boardData\":[{\"id\":2743,\"documentId\":\"z4kn577f3lgw4op1eoh83xw4\",\"title\":\"Board of Directors\",\"description\":\"Our board of esteemed industry experts help us to navigate the changing business landscape and embrace new opportunities for innovation.\",\"sectionSlug\":\"who-we-are-board-members\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-06-30T08:40:30.328Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-16T10:18:40.306Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-16T10:18:40.342Z\",\"locale\":\"en\",\"page\":\"who-we-are\",\"button\":{\"id\":10093,\"title\":\"View Board Committees\",\"url\":\"#\"},\"collection\":[{\"id\":72,\"leaders_profiles\":[{\"order\":10,\"id\":537,\"documentId\":\"uva6d95zxouf0kk5m8hisbmp\",\"title\":\"Faisal Husain\",\"description\":\"$31\",\"designation\":\"Co-founder and CEO\",\"secondaryDesignation\":null,\"leadersProfileURL\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/faisal-husain-4082782\",\"boardOrLeadership\":\"Board\",\"showDetailsPage\":true,\"boardMemberAudit\":\"NA\",\"boardMemberNominatingAndGovernance\":\"NA\",\"boardMemberCompensationAndHumanCapital\":\"NA\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-06-30T07:15:38.064Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-09-01T12:12:45.263Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-01T12:12:45.329Z\",\"locale\":\"en\",\"image\":{\"id\":5165,\"documentId\":\"b9mhrcvb2lq2d97c3gubn457\",